405 66 305Q60 285 60 284Q58 278 41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAINB-62\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-2208\" x=\"917\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1862,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJAMS-52\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMATHI-6E\" x=\"1021\" y=\"581\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is a fixed vector. </p>\n<p>We wish to find an expression for the gradient of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.925ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 829 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">f.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMATHI-66\" d=\"M118 -162Q120 -162 124 -164T135 -167T147 -168Q160 -168 171 -155T187 -126Q197 -99 221 27T267 267T289 382V385H242Q195 385 192 387Q188 390 188 397L195 425Q197 430 203 430T250 431Q298 431 298 432Q298 434 307 482T319 540Q356 705 465 705Q502 703 526 683T550 630Q550 594 529 578T487 561Q443 561 443 603Q443 622 454 636T478 657L487 662Q471 668 457 668Q445 668 434 658T419 630Q412 601 403 552T387 469T380 433Q380 431 435 431Q480 431 487 430T498 424Q499 420 496 407T491 391Q489 386 482 386T428 385H372L349 263Q301 15 282 -47Q255 -132 212 -173Q175 -205 139 -205Q107 -205 81 -186T55 -132Q55 -95 76 -78T118 -61Q162 -61 162 -103Q162 -122 151 -136T127 -157L118 -162Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJM